      "updated": 1784414561225,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Compute Environment (CE)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Compute Environment (CE)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "58Imsn-7nXbSwab9lgmPp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1543.1781625560075,
      "y": 1861.0286717324645,
      "width": 1541.7746582031243,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1470540327,
      "version": 797,
      "versionNonce": 218968607,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785715119539,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Onde os jobs rodam. \n- Conjunto de recursos computacionais (EC2 ou Fargate)\n    Fargate = zero gestão de AMI, mas sem GPU, limite de 20 vCPU/120GB e sem acesso a disco local grande.\n    EC2 = GPU, instâncias grandes, Spot, storage local.\n\nDefine:\n    - tipos de instância\n    - min/max vCPU\n    - uso de Spot\n    - desiredvCpus\n    - allocation strategy\n    - subnets e security groups.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Onde os jobs rodam. \n- Conjunto de recursos computacionais (EC2 ou Fargate)\n    Fargate = zero gestão de AMI, mas sem GPU, limite de 20 vCPU/120GB e sem acesso a disco local grande.\n    EC2 = GPU, instâncias grandes, Spot, storage local.\n\nDefine:\n    - tipos de instância\n    - min/max vCPU\n    - uso de Spot\n    - desiredvCpus\n    - allocation strategy\n    - subnets e security groups.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zkUAH29cKE05YVcLEotcN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1543.1781625560075,
      "y": 2380.0286717324648,
      "width": 363.8614807128906,
      "height": 35,
