    {
      "id": "rjj-BQP_Rwxtlcvzz_GDA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7845.279737290916,
      "y": 3395.5167669705597,
      "width": 749.3919881184897,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 196514055,
      "version": 512,
      "versionNonce": 1030518183,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785764534049,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "👉 O ECS Service é estado contínuo desejado\n\n- “quero 5 tasks sempre rodando”\n- self-healing\n- load balancer\n\n\n👉 O Batch é execução sob demanda (fila)\n\n- “quero executar esse job”\n- termina e morre\n- não mantém nada vivo",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "👉 O ECS Service é estado contínuo desejado\n\n- “quero 5 tasks sempre rodando”\n- self-healing\n- load balancer\n\n\n👉 O Batch é execução sob demanda (fila)\n\n- “quero executar esse job”\n- termina e morre\n- não mantém nada vivo",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ygshpXVhum3HDuZe5paP8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7901.059114936962,
      "y": 3678.016766970559,
      "width": 620.138427734375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
