      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Step Functions integra\nnativamente via .sync\n(aguarda o job terminar).\n\nMAS: .sync NAO vale\npara array jobs.\n\nPara arrays ->\nsubmeta 1 job e reaja\nvia EventBridge, ou use\nMap state com jobs\nindividuais.",
      "originalText": "Step Functions integra\nnativamente via .sync\n(aguarda o job terminar).\n\nMAS: .sync NAO vale\npara array jobs.\n\nPara arrays ->\nsubmeta 1 job e reaja\nvia EventBridge, ou use\nMap state com jobs\nindividuais.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
