      "text": "Variáveis de ambiente",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "uvx_CfEij52cTzMM2LFTo",
      "originalText": "Variáveis de ambiente",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "baqL8FIBnXXNtHICzcwdQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2438.4751144875886,
      "y": 5707.6017486763885,
      "width": 888.64208984375,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1996869181,
      "version": 454,
      "versionNonce": 450191879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785765121463,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWS_BATCH_JOB_ID      — o ID do job. Em child de array, vem no formato <id-pai>:<índice>.\nAWS_BATCH_JOB_ATTEMPT — número da tentativa.\n\n- Só em array jobs (child)\nAWS_BATCH_JOB_ARRAY_INDEX — o índice do child, de 0 a N-1. É o único diferenciador entre os children.\nAWS_BATCH_JOB_ARRAY_SIZE  — o size do array pai, repassado ao child.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWS_BATCH_JOB_ID      — o ID do job. Em child de array, vem no formato <id-pai>:<índice>.\nAWS_BATCH_JOB_ATTEMPT — número da tentativa.\n\n- Só em array jobs (child)\nAWS_BATCH_JOB_ARRAY_INDEX — o índice do child, de 0 a N-1. É o único diferenciador entre os children.\nAWS_BATCH_JOB_ARRAY_SIZE  — o size do array pai, repassado ao child.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tgCmjEZ9NTFYEvxSm4HFf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2855.495345311002,
      "y": 7089.942634537246,
      "width": 460.62481689453125,
      "height": 45.173641866292556,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baV",
