    {
      "id": "nZZ2GodcQETIb8oYivAOC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9559.129700350526,
      "y": 3335.674298261809,
      "width": 420.3795471191406,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "baoV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 745404852,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 1751016244,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786024533226,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Porque o Batch resolve outro problema:\n\nEle não precisa de Service porque:\n- não existe conceito de “estado contínuo”\n- não existe “desired count”\n- não existe “long-running worker”\n\nO que existe:\n- Job Queue → controla execução\n- Scheduler → decide quando rodar\n- Compute Environment → provisiona infra",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "VSM1_NpIeoYZMmMJSBCMm",
      "originalText": "Porque o Batch resolve outro problema:\n\nEle não precisa de Service porque:\n- não existe conceito de “estado contínuo”\n- não existe “desired count”\n- não existe “long-running worker”\n\nO que existe:\n- Job Queue → controla execução\n- Scheduler → decide quando rodar\n- Compute Environment → provisiona infra",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l8O2EsMx5WWItLwBEsIhM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9554.129700350526,
      "y": 3274.5286171518296,
      "width": 433.805908203125,
      "height": 32.199999999999996,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 852263180,
      "version": 108,
